1
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:15,240
{\an8}<i>hikaru kumo wo tsukinuke</i>

2
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:15,240
<i>Breaking through the flying clouds, I...</i>

3
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:17,780
{\an8}<i>Fly Away < Fly Away ></i>

4
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:17,780
Fly Away < Fly Away >

5
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:24,170
{\an8}<i>karadajuu ni hirogaru panorama</i>

6
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:24,170
<i>A panorama spreading throughout my body</i>

7
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:27,500
{\an8}<i>kao wo kerareta chikyuu ga</i>

8
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:27,500
<i>Kicked in the face, the Earth gets</i>

9
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,050
{\an8}<i>okotte < okotte ></i>

10
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,050
<i>Angry < Angry ></i>

11
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:36,640
{\an8}<i>kazan wo bakuhatsu saseru</i>

12
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:36,640
<i>And makes a volcano explode</i>

13
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:43,640
{\an8}<i>toketa koori no naka ni</i>

14
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:43,640
<i>If, in the melted polar ice,</i>

15
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:51,230
{\an8}<i>kyouryuu ga itara tamanori shikomitai ne</i>

16
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:51,230
<i>There is a dinosaur, I want to train it to ride on a ball</i>

17
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:55,860
{\an8}<i>CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA</i>

18
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:04,790
{\an8}<i>nani ga okite mo kibun wa heno heno kappa</i>

19
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:04,790
<i>Whatever happens, it won't bother me one bit</i>

20
00:01:04,790 --> 00:01:09,670
{\an8}<i>CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA mune ga</i>

21
00:01:09,670 --> 00:01:12,590
{\an8}<i>pachi-pachi suru hodo sawagu</i>

22
00:01:09,670 --> 00:01:12,590
<i>As loud as my heart pounds,</i>

23
00:01:12,590 --> 00:01:14,550
{\an8}<i>Genki Dama</i>

24
00:01:12,590 --> 00:01:14,550
<i>The Genki Dama roars.</i>

25
00:01:14,550 --> 00:01:17,760
{\an8}<i>CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA</i>

26
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:26,770
{\an8}<i>atama karappo no hou ga yume tsumekomeru</i>

27
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:26,770
<i>A head that's empty is easier to stuff with dreams</i>

28
00:01:26,770 --> 00:01:30,360
{\an8}<i>CHA-LA HEAD-CHA-LA</i>

29
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:34,110
{\an8}<i>egao urutora Z de</i>

30
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:34,110
<i>With a smile that's Ultra-Z</i>

31
00:01:34,110 --> 00:01:37,160
{\an8}<i>kyou mo ai-yai-yai-yai-yai......</i>

32
00:01:34,110 --> 00:01:37,160
<i>Even today is ai-yai-yai-yai-yai......</i>

33
00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:39,240
{\an8}<i>Sparking!</i>

34
00:01:51,890 --> 00:01:56,480
<i>The hour of the fated Cell Games had finally arrived.</i>

35
00:02:06,460 --> 00:02:10,610
Okay then, let's make contemptuous faces at him! Nyaah!

36
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:15,110
And I'll give him a good spanky-spanky!

37
00:02:49,980 --> 00:02:52,320
Welcome, all of you!

38
00:02:58,110 --> 00:02:59,660
How about that?!

39
00:03:07,900 --> 00:03:09,420
It's time!

40
00:03:14,980 --> 00:03:22,930
{\an8}Just a Moment!!

41
00:03:14,980 --> 00:03:22,930
{\an8}The Satan Squad Goes On the Rampage

42
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:42,700
Whoever goes first is fine with me.

43
00:03:44,700 --> 00:03:48,460
Of course, that will be me. It's only natural I'd be the one.

44
00:03:48,900 --> 00:03:52,850
Don't do it, Goku. These guys just won't understand, even if you do tell them.

45
00:03:52,850 --> 00:03:54,590
I can't let that happen.

46
00:03:54,590 --> 00:03:58,300
You're gonna get killed! Trust me on this, give it up!

47
00:04:05,230 --> 00:04:08,980
Hey, cameraman, get a shot of that dimwit over there.

48
00:04:08,980 --> 00:04:09,650
Right.

49
00:04:13,110 --> 00:04:17,800
It's almost as if I can hear the voices of all the world in my ears, saying "Oh, my word!"

50
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:23,410
Does this man realize what he just said to Mister Satan?!

51
00:04:23,890 --> 00:04:25,730
Of all the things to say at this moment,

52
00:04:25,730 --> 00:04:30,150
"You're gonna get killed! Trust me on this, give it up!"

53
00:04:30,150 --> 00:04:32,170
That's what he said!

54
00:04:38,710 --> 00:04:42,390
<i>It's because of things like this that ignorant bumpkins are an embarrassment to the rest of us!</i>

55
00:04:43,210 --> 00:04:48,560
<i>After all of our explaining who Satan is, he still doesn't get it!</i>

56
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:52,590
There's no helping those kinds of folks, huh?

57
00:04:52,590 --> 00:04:54,210
He looks like him...

58
00:04:54,770 --> 00:04:58,780
That man looks like him...

59
00:04:59,860 --> 00:05:08,450
That child, who once upon a time, saved us all from Piccolo Daimao...

60
00:05:15,370 --> 00:05:19,360
However, he didn't have the same eye or hair color.

61
00:05:20,780 --> 00:05:22,440
It must be someone else...

62
00:05:24,490 --> 00:05:28,470
Be that as it may, it's this man that concerns me.

63
00:05:28,890 --> 00:05:31,480
N-No matter how I look at him,

64
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:35,480
I can't help but think that he is that same Piccolo Daimao...

65
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:39,260
Look, it's all right, just let those idiots do as they like.

66
00:05:39,850 --> 00:05:43,230
Even if they are killed, they can be brought back to life with the Dragon Balls.

67
00:05:44,330 --> 00:05:46,490
Ah, well, I guess there ain't much choice, huh?

68
00:05:47,970 --> 00:05:50,990
Oh, it appears that he has finally been convinced!

69
00:05:50,990 --> 00:05:53,040
Which is to say, it's only natural.

70
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:57,300
Could he have realized that his life has been spared?

71
00:05:57,300 --> 00:05:59,520
They finally understand, huh?

72
00:05:59,520 --> 00:06:03,090
This nonsensical group has been nothing but an annoyance to Mister Satan!

73
00:06:03,090 --> 00:06:06,000
As we pull ourselves together, the match can finally continue once again!

74
00:06:07,510 --> 00:06:09,390
<i>Please wait, Sensei!</i>

75
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:25,740
Wh-What's this?

76
00:06:41,260 --> 00:06:44,960
A mysterious group of people has appeared before Mister Satan!

77
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:46,930
Who in the world could they be?!

78
00:06:47,980 --> 00:06:50,260
We've got more weirdos showing up!

79
00:06:50,890 --> 00:06:54,560
We are Mister Satan's finest pupils!

80
00:07:00,010 --> 00:07:03,400
The world's most gorgeous man, Caroni, the Swift!

81
00:07:09,830 --> 00:07:14,170
The world's most staggeringly strong man, Piroshki the Mighty!

82
00:07:18,750 --> 00:07:23,490
A-Apparently, these two are acquaintances of Mister Satan.

83
00:07:24,110 --> 00:07:25,980
Allow me to explain.

84
00:07:26,650 --> 00:07:30,310
These two men are Mister Satan's first and second pupils,

85
00:07:30,310 --> 00:07:34,010
and are the next-to-greatest, and next-to-next-to greatest warriors,

86
00:07:34,010 --> 00:07:37,520
compared to the warrior who boasts the greatest speed and power.

87
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:41,070
Oh, that is incredible!

88
00:07:41,070 --> 00:07:44,950
And I am their beautiful manager, Piiza.

89
00:07:46,030 --> 00:07:49,030
Sensei, there is no need for you to get your own hands dirty

90
00:07:49,030 --> 00:07:51,280
against such a rank amateur.

91
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:54,790
W-We can easily defeat him!

92
00:07:54,790 --> 00:07:57,380
Hmm, perhaps so.

93
00:07:58,090 --> 00:08:02,800
It might be a bit childish of me to take on such a rank amateur myself.

94
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:04,640
I leave him to you!

95
00:08:08,550 --> 00:08:12,430
People of the world, did you hear that?!

96
00:08:12,890 --> 00:08:14,770
Mister Satan has clearly announced

97
00:08:14,770 --> 00:08:20,060
that these two top pupils of his will defeat Cell in his place!

98
00:08:20,940 --> 00:08:23,590
And what promising assistants they appear to be!

99
00:08:23,590 --> 00:08:27,180
Our victory is now all the more assured!

100
00:08:32,780 --> 00:08:35,060
Caroni and Piroshki!

101
00:08:35,060 --> 00:08:37,260
I've seen their pictures in magazines!

102
00:08:37,260 --> 00:08:39,080
They're Satan's favorite pupils,

103
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:42,320
and have won a great deal of fighting tournaments!

104
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:44,800
That's awesome!

105
00:08:46,130 --> 00:08:47,800
<i>Idiots...!</i>

106
00:08:47,800 --> 00:08:49,520
There's more of them now...

107
00:08:50,330 --> 00:08:51,300
those fools.

108
00:08:51,700 --> 00:08:54,250
And so, the Cell Games resume!

109
00:08:54,250 --> 00:08:59,270
First up is Mister Satan's top pupil, Contestant Caroni the Swift!

110
00:08:59,990 --> 00:09:04,050
And so, I, Caroni, will be your opponent.

111
00:09:04,050 --> 00:09:05,210
Very good.

112
00:09:05,820 --> 00:09:07,630
<i>Mmm, sweet...!</i>

113
00:09:29,900 --> 00:09:33,740
These are a parting gift for you, as you are about to enter the ground.

114
00:09:35,400 --> 00:09:36,520
Caroni-sama!

115
00:09:36,520 --> 00:09:39,480
He's so cool!

116
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:41,260
Magnificent!

117
00:09:41,260 --> 00:09:44,980
What a graceful, elegant, yet bewitching technique!

118
00:09:45,620 --> 00:09:47,510
Allow me to explain.

119
00:09:47,510 --> 00:09:49,930
He is a master of the aerial death strike,

120
00:09:49,930 --> 00:09:53,490
and can even snatch a swallow as it flies through the air.

121
00:09:53,490 --> 00:09:55,550
That is incredible!

122
00:09:55,550 --> 00:09:59,540
As one might expect of Satan's top pupil, his abilities are in a league of their own!

123
00:10:00,450 --> 00:10:03,000
What's the deal with this guy?

124
00:10:04,510 --> 00:10:09,000
<i>That move must have floored 100,000 of my female fans.</i>

125
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:16,490
And so, the Cell Games, with the fate of the world in the balance,

126
00:10:16,490 --> 00:10:18,330
have now begun!

127
00:10:19,010 --> 00:10:22,170
The rules are simple: if you fall outside of this ring, you lose;

128
00:10:22,170 --> 00:10:25,300
if you give up, you lose; and if you die, you lose!

129
00:10:26,950 --> 00:10:28,710
Are you afraid?

130
00:10:28,710 --> 00:10:32,030
Not to worry, the suffering will only last a moment.

131
00:10:32,730 --> 00:10:36,660
Beautiful... Rose... Flying...

132
00:10:36,660 --> 00:10:39,160
Attack!

133
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:42,190
Oh, my! What a super jump!

134
00:10:42,190 --> 00:10:44,950
This is Caroni's greatest, most inscrutable finishing technique!

135
00:10:44,950 --> 00:10:47,040
This match has already seen its conclusion.

136
00:10:52,270 --> 00:10:53,800
"Big Finish" time...

137
00:11:01,970 --> 00:11:04,270
Incredible! He's still flying up!

138
00:11:14,740 --> 00:11:17,300
I-Is he still flying up...?

139
00:11:18,060 --> 00:11:20,340
He must be in superb shape.

140
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:23,750
Wh-What could that sound be?

141
00:11:36,800 --> 00:11:40,970
Wh-What could have happened, exactly?

142
00:11:40,970 --> 00:11:44,330
S-Surely, he must have jumped too high.

143
00:11:47,810 --> 00:11:53,560
He's good at doing this, but he has a bad habit of getting carried away.

144
00:11:54,190 --> 00:11:57,320
Therein lies the reason why he cannot surpass me.

145
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:59,720
That's correct!

146
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:01,080
I see!

147
00:12:26,060 --> 00:12:27,580
What happened?

148
00:12:26,620 --> 00:12:28,450
My Caroni-sama!

149
00:12:27,580 --> 00:12:28,450
Stupid jerk!

150
00:12:28,450 --> 00:12:31,900
<i>As luck would have it, Contestant Caroni the Swift has lost by ring out,</i>

151
00:12:31,900 --> 00:12:35,150
<i>and though a gifted warrior, he meets with valorous defeat. Truly, this is a shame!</i>

152
00:12:43,370 --> 00:12:46,200
I-I will defeat Cell!

153
00:12:51,140 --> 00:12:52,720
Allow me to explain.

154
00:12:53,370 --> 00:12:56,190
His monstrous strength rivals that of 20 elephants,

155
00:12:56,190 --> 00:12:58,420
and he can flatten a bull with one blow.

156
00:12:58,420 --> 00:13:01,140
Th-That does indeed sound fierce.

157
00:13:10,810 --> 00:13:14,700
F-Fantastic! What fantastic power!

158
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:24,160
Wh-What colossal strength!

159
00:13:24,160 --> 00:13:28,000
Cell does not stand a chance against him! They're on two completely different levels!

160
00:13:28,490 --> 00:13:32,660
Knowing Piroshki, he won't make the same kind of blunder as Caroni did.

161
00:13:32,660 --> 00:13:34,500
You have to feel sorry for Cell.

162
00:14:04,930 --> 00:14:08,690
Oh, my! Contestant Piroshki has begun a ferocious dash!

163
00:14:08,690 --> 00:14:12,210
This is Contestant Piroshki's Megaton Bull Crusher!

164
00:14:12,210 --> 00:14:15,500
At this point, there's no one that can stop him!

165
00:14:35,020 --> 00:14:36,480
What could have happened?

166
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:39,530
Contestant Piroshki's motion has stopped!

167
00:14:55,300 --> 00:14:56,920
I-I give up!

168
00:15:05,970 --> 00:15:12,100
Wh-What in the world just happened? Mister Satan...?

169
00:15:14,530 --> 00:15:15,600
It's a trick.

170
00:15:16,980 --> 00:15:20,260
He is considerably afraid of me, you see.

171
00:15:20,260 --> 00:15:24,990
He has set up tricks all around the dueling ring. Damned bastard...!

172
00:15:25,550 --> 00:15:28,410
It's possible that he has soaked his entire body

173
00:15:28,410 --> 00:15:30,830
with the smell of green peppers, which Piroshki despises,

174
00:15:30,830 --> 00:15:34,390
or he might have rigged nails to stick up out of the floor.

175
00:15:36,900 --> 00:15:40,250
But I will expose his tricks!

176
00:15:40,250 --> 00:15:42,150
So that's it!

177
00:15:42,150 --> 00:15:45,010
I don't know when he might have done it, though...

178
00:15:45,610 --> 00:15:49,850
What a dirty trick to use in a one-on-one fight!

179
00:15:49,850 --> 00:15:52,450
I'm telling you, that's not it!

180
00:15:52,450 --> 00:15:55,990
Those two were tossed around by Cell's <i>ki.</i>

181
00:15:55,990 --> 00:15:57,730
Figure it out already, would you?

182
00:15:57,730 --> 00:16:02,080
And so, having had his beloved pupils beaten by foul play,

183
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:04,740
Mister Satan gathers his fury and once again enters the ring!

184
00:16:05,530 --> 00:16:07,340
He removes his cape...

185
00:16:08,750 --> 00:16:12,760
and now, he has removed his glorious champion belt!

186
00:16:13,490 --> 00:16:18,780
<i>And so, our hero, Mister Satan, has taken the stage!</i>

187
00:16:21,640 --> 00:16:24,740
This match will determine the fate of the Earth!

188
00:16:24,740 --> 00:16:28,350
Our world combat sport champion Mister Satan

189
00:16:28,350 --> 00:16:33,220
has gleefully commented to us that he has been looking forward to this day!

190
00:16:36,810 --> 00:16:41,670
Oh? Mister Satan has pulled something from out of his breast pocket.

191
00:16:41,670 --> 00:16:44,780
It's a capsule! He has pulled out a capsule...

192
00:16:49,280 --> 00:16:54,150
Oh, it's his bag! An enormous bag has come forth from the capsule!

193
00:16:54,150 --> 00:16:56,420
Now then, what could be inside the bag?

194
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:01,330
Roofing tiles!

195
00:17:01,330 --> 00:17:03,590
There were roofing tiles inside!

196
00:17:04,170 --> 00:17:07,840
Mister Satan is delicately stacking the tiles!

197
00:17:08,290 --> 00:17:10,330
Oh, man...!

198
00:17:10,330 --> 00:17:12,340
Hey now, you don't suppose he's...?

199
00:17:12,340 --> 00:17:14,800
The stack numbers...

200
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:17,550
15 tiles! 15 tiles!

201
00:17:21,020 --> 00:17:25,110
He has taken 15 roofing tiles and stacked them high!

202
00:17:31,700 --> 00:17:34,480
And now, he's focusing his mind!

203
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:40,460
Mister Satan is concentrating his power!

204
00:17:41,690 --> 00:17:44,730
Let's remain quiet for this now...

205
00:18:08,780 --> 00:18:12,530
Oh, my! Only one remains!

206
00:18:13,580 --> 00:18:16,230
Still, this is incredible! What terrific destructive force!

207
00:18:16,230 --> 00:18:20,870
14 tiles! 14 tiles have been shattered to pieces!

208
00:18:48,510 --> 00:18:50,730
<i>He's a genuine idiot.</i>

209
00:18:50,730 --> 00:18:55,240
Cell! Take a look at these tiles that have been smashed to pieces!

210
00:18:57,610 --> 00:18:59,540
In one more minute...

211
00:19:00,760 --> 00:19:02,250
this is how you will look.

212
00:19:05,580 --> 00:19:13,260
Satan! Satan! Satan! Satan!

213
00:19:15,740 --> 00:19:18,230
I've just gone numb!

214
00:19:18,230 --> 00:19:20,360
Such is the world's Satan!

215
00:19:20,360 --> 00:19:23,230
I have just been intensely moved!

216
00:19:23,710 --> 00:19:27,480
<i>I nailed it! I absolutely nailed it just now!</i>

217
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:31,120
<i>It's a good thing I'm taping this on my video recorder.</i>

218
00:19:32,370 --> 00:19:35,830
He's losing his nerve! Even Cell, with all of his big talk,

219
00:19:35,830 --> 00:19:41,160
can't help but lose his nerve after seeing the destructive force of Mister Satan!

220
00:19:41,910 --> 00:19:45,430
However, it's too late for him to make apologies!

221
00:19:45,430 --> 00:19:48,500
The people of the world will not forgive Cell's crimes!

222
00:19:50,540 --> 00:19:52,390
All right, come on!

223
00:19:52,390 --> 00:19:57,010
And so, Mister Satan takes up a completely combative stance!

224
00:19:57,590 --> 00:20:00,650
The world's number one combat sport warrior by far,

225
00:20:00,650 --> 00:20:02,510
Mister Satan, versus Cell!

226
00:20:02,510 --> 00:20:08,020
The iron fist of justice is about to burst upon Cell, who has taken so many human lives!

227
00:20:08,020 --> 00:20:13,820
Satan! Satan! Satan!

228
00:20:13,820 --> 00:20:16,080
Come on, Mister Satan!

229
00:20:16,080 --> 00:20:18,660
If possible, we'd like for you to beat Cell by killing him!

230
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:31,050
Ah, there he goes!

231
00:20:31,050 --> 00:20:33,840
Contestant Satan immediately launches into some grand techniques!

232
00:20:33,840 --> 00:20:35,980
His <i>Dynamite Kick</i> has erupted against Cell!

233
00:20:35,980 --> 00:20:38,800
Has this match already been decided?!

234
00:20:44,160 --> 00:20:47,810
Contestant Satan does not let up with his attack!

235
00:20:51,980 --> 00:20:56,380
He's raining blows upon him! He's raining blows upon Cell! Cell is helpless to defend himself!

236
00:20:56,380 --> 00:21:00,420
He's strong! He's more than strong! Such is our champion, Mister Satan!

237
00:21:04,750 --> 00:21:06,330
Hey, now to finish you!

238
00:21:06,330 --> 00:21:07,550
Stop pestering me!

239
00:21:09,740 --> 00:21:11,240
{\an8}"Conk"

240
00:21:17,350 --> 00:21:18,550
Huh...?

241
00:21:20,100 --> 00:21:24,890
In all honesty, I was kind of rooting for Cell just now.

242
00:21:29,910 --> 00:21:32,530
Geez, he's still alive?

243
